cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Matrix Context, please cite it as below."
title: "Matrix Context: A Local-First, Inspectable Mixture-of-Contexts Layer for Agent Memory"
abstract: >-
  Matrix Context routes each query to a small subset of typed context experts,
  retrieves with hybrid lexical and dense fusion, and assembles a token-budgeted,
  explainable context pack. A Python library and (staged) MCP server for agent memory.
